<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>How to Shop on ChapterChase - Your Guide to Literary Discoveries</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #3498db;
            --secondary-color: #2c3e50;
            --accent-color: #e74c3c;
            --background-color: #f4f4f4;
            --text-color: #333;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: var(--background-color);
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        main {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .shopping-steps {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        
        .step {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .step:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        
        .step-number {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-right: 1.5rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .step-content h2 {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .step-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .step-content ul {
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .cta {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #c0392b;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .step {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .step-number {
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>How to Shop on ChapterChase</h1>
            <p>Your Guide to Literary Discoveries</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="shopping-steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>Browse Our Collection</h2>
                    <p>Explore our vast library of books across various genres:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Use the search bar to find specific titles or authors</li>
                        <li>Navigate through categories to discover new reads</li>
                        <li>Check out our featured books and bestseller lists</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>Select Your Books</h2>
                    <p>When you find a book you like:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Click on the book to view more details</li>
                        <li>Read reviews from other readers</li>
                        <li>Choose your preferred format (hardcover, paperback, or ebook)</li>
                        <li>Click "Add to Cart" to select the book</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>Review Your Cart</h2>
                    <p>Before proceeding to checkout:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Review the items in your cart</li>
                        <li>Adjust quantities if needed</li>
                        <li>Apply any promo codes for discounts</li>
                        <li>Click "Proceed to Checkout" when ready</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">4</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>Checkout and Payment</h2>
                    <p>Complete your purchase:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Enter your shipping information</li>
                        <li>Choose your preferred shipping method</li>
                        <li>Select your payment method (credit card, PayPal, etc.)</li>
                        <li>Review your order details and total</li>
                        <li>Click "Place Order" to complete your purchase</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">5</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>Track Your Order</h2>
                    <p>Stay updated on your delivery:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Receive an order confirmation email</li>
                        <li>Log in to your account to view order status</li>
                        <li>Get shipping notifications and tracking information</li>
                        <li>Contact our customer support if you have any questions</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <div class="cta">
            <a href="#" class="button">Start Shopping Now</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>